     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "When adding the AddDatastreamByReference and AddDatastreamByValue methods, leave the existing AddDatastream method in place so as not to break any existing code.  Update documentation to mark the method as deprecated, and consider removing in a future release.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Ensure new methods are catered for in any default security policies (including FeSL).",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Document in release notes that the new methods may require securing in security policies that users have created.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
